<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 31.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 31.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     July 31     July 30   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  286.460     288.030     247.020   15.97 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  308.000     308.390     306.830    0.38 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.210     156.430     158.970   -1.74 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.334	46.410	47.182   -1.80 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  468.680     468.140     419.180   11.81 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  138.685     138.940     141.685   -2.12 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.009	16.048	16.185   -1.09 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  242.150     242.480     212.430   13.99 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.851	 1.855	 1.888   -1.96 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.546	 1.550	 1.581   -2.21 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  188.955     189.220     183.135    3.18 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
